			x: 2.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["69BDA9FBB0EB66F2"]
			description: [
				"Logs, a crafting table and stone tools, as in any world. Vanilla tools are enough for the first ore; GregTech's own are a few steps away."
